crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=33b16e6ccdf15952976d8fb36e153dd5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/72bf93da/uploads/origins/6d66bac9-f780-4f4f-a2f6-b70ec8c5f75b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=407069de879b495d7016ecfa0fcaf784 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your artwork, especially your fire emblem works. Commissioning you would be a huge honor. \n\nI would like to request artwork of Reinhardt from fire emblem. (References: https://imgur.com/a/iw4mDf1)\n\nNote: Reinhardt's hair is black. It may look brown, but it's actually black. \n\nHe is spending time with his horse and feeding it apples or carrots, or grooming it with a brush. Teacher can decide. I will leave the background to teacher. Please give Reinhardt a kind smile.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kh_kyo_hibiki/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9d9533d7/uploads/origins/eb2d72ec-38a7-41cd-aa88-6f6b3b1fa5b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70aad6452228b0daa4c81833ef20b7e2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9d9533d7/uploads/origins/eb2d72ec-38a7-41cd-aa88-6f6b3b1fa5b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70aad6452228b0daa4c81833ef20b7e2, https://si.imgix.net/9d9533d7/uploads/origins/eb2d72ec-38a7-41cd-aa88-6f6b3b1fa5b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=964e3d0a3e5ba116810c8be5d57dfd5f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9d9533d7/uploads/origins/eb2d72ec-38a7-41cd-aa88-6f6b3b1fa5b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57541611aba9fa779d3880a354adc39a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "前回のリクエストありがとうございました！子供の頃のローエンをお願いしたいです。茶色の馬の背に乗り、片手にピクニックバスケット、片手にランスを持っていてほしいです。幸せな少年であってほしい。気まぐれでかわいい子になってほしい。\n\n普段着はサイファーの画服の色と合わせてほしい https://imgur.com/a/C2v6Zma", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kh_kyo_hibiki/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "http